        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Environmental regulations apply equally regardless of company age or size. All manufacturing facilities require Consent to Establish before construction and Consent to Operate before production begins. Designing low-VOC processes from inception costs significantly less than retrofitting existing facilities and accelerates permit approvals."
      }
