      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How often must I conduct VOC emission monitoring?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Monitoring frequency depends on your Consent to Operate conditions and industry category. Facilities typically conduct stack emission monitoring quarterly to annually. Continuous processes with high VOC potential may require Continuous Emission Monitoring Systems. Workplace air monitoring is required at least annually. All records must be maintained for a minimum of 5 years and annual environmental statements submitted to your State Pollution Control Board."
